[label=ropa] Clotheslines strung between abandoned adobe houses carry white shirts and long dresses that billow in the wind as if invisible people were still wearing them, sleeves lifting like arms, dreamy faded 35mm film still for a music video, soft fog, muted desaturated color, gentle halation and fine grain. Wide shot down a narrow empty street at eye level, the clotheslines crossing the frame at different depths. Soft morning fog with pale backlight, colors of faded white, dusty terracotta, sage and grey-blue, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=marimba] An old wooden marimba stands alone in the middle of an empty town plaza, fallen leaves stirring across its keys in the wind as if someone were playing it, a dry fountain and closed shutters behind, dreamy faded 35mm film still for a music video, soft fog, muted desaturated color, gentle halation and fine grain. Medium-wide shot at eye level, the marimba centered. Low golden late-afternoon light through drifting fog, colors of honey wood, faded ochre, dusty rose and grey, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=campana] Inside the dim stone bell tower of an abandoned church, a thick rope hangs from a bronze bell and swings by itself, dust falling through a shaft of light from the open arch, dreamy faded 35mm film still for a music video, soft fog, muted desaturated color, gentle halation and fine grain. Low angle looking up the tower, the rope running down the center toward the camera, the bell dark at the top. A single beam of pale light from the arch on the left, colors of stone grey, bronze, faded gold and shadow blue, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=mural] Jungle vines and broad leaves grow over a faded painted mural of musicians and dancers on the wall of an abandoned building, the painted faces half hidden by green, dreamy faded 35mm film still for a music video, soft fog, muted desaturated color, gentle halation and fine grain. Medium shot straight on, the mural filling the frame, leaves spilling in from the top and right. Soft diffuse green light, colors of faded mural reds and blues, deep jungle green and weathered white, no text, no watermark.
[label=ventanas] An empty street of old houses at blue hour where every window still glows warm yellow behind thin curtains, the street wet and silent, fog drifting between the lamp posts, dreamy faded 35mm film still for a music video, soft fog, muted desaturated color, gentle halation and fine grain. Wide shot at eye level looking down the middle of the street, the lit windows lining both sides toward a vanishing point. Warm window light against cool blue dusk, colors of warm yellow, deep blue, wet grey and soft black, no people, no text, no watermark.
